<title>SOUTH KOREA: Nong Shim Co sets bonus, rights issues.</title>
<headline>Nong Shim Co sets bonus, rights issues.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's Nong Shim Co plans to offer a 24-for-100 bonus issue in April and a 23-for-100 rights issue in June, a company statement said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>After the issues, Nong Shim's paid-in capital would rise to 27 billion won from 16.88 billion won at present, it said.</p>
</text>
